<title>UK: Bardon, CAMAS extend merger deadline.</title>
<headline>Bardon, CAMAS extend merger deadline.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British-based building materials firms Bardon Group and CAMAS Plc said on Tuesday they had extended the deadline for their merger deal to May 27.</p>
<p>As of Monday, valid acceptances representing about 83.82 percent of CAMAS's ordinary share capital had been received, the companies said in a statement.</p>
<p>Under the deal, CAMAS and Bardon will merge to form a company called Aggregate Industries. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
